20
00:01:03,934 --> 00:01:05,934
♪ Floating in the bathtub ♪

21
00:01:05,934 --> 00:01:07,701
♪ Swimming in the pool ♪

22
00:01:07,701 --> 00:01:09,167
♪ I'll be an astronaut ♪

